<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-BARCELONA SIGN AMUNIKE FROM SPORTING LISBON.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BARCELONA SIGN AMUNIKE FROM SPORTING LISBON.</headline>
<dateline>BARCELONA 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nigerian striker Emanuel Amunike has joined Barcelona from Sporting Lisbon for a fee estimated at 500 million pesetas ($3.85 million), the Catalan club said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Barcelona doctors, worried by the Nigerian's knee problem, had twice advised the club against buying Amunike, who is expected to cover the gap on the left wing left vacant by injured Bulgarian international Hristo Stoichkov.</p>
</text>
